  "notes": "5:1-3 is not glossed (As-Sa'di gives two readings of «وإن تعجب»). Their claim (5:4-11) is framed «بزعمهم»; the chains and the Fire (5:16-25) are never drawn or glossed. 6-7 address the Prophet ﷺ: no plate on him. Light for «وإن ربك لذو مغفرة للناس على ظلمهم» (it leaves before «لشديد العقاب»), a lamp for «ولكل قوم هاد». Their demand (7:1-9) is framed as an excuse."
